{"id":"200e7013fdc02d77","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-modifiedchowproperties.md","title":"Signs and duality of modified Chow parameters","display":"thm-modifiedchowproperties — Signs and duality of modified Chow parameters","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-modifiedchowproperties","aliases":["27-thm-modifiedchowproperties"],"display":"thm-modifiedchowproperties — Signs and duality of modified Chow parameters","depends_on":["[[27-df-chow]]","[[27-df-dual]]","[[27-df-variablepolarity]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§9.6.2 Theorem 9.24","source_printed_pages":"431–432","source_pdf_pages":"455–456","verification_status":"source-statement-and-counting-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-modifiedchowproperties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-modifiedchowproperties</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-modifiedchowproperties — Signs and duality of modified Chow parameters"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"260aad3bc2408854\" href=\"?note=260aad3bc2408854\" title=\"27-df-chow\">27-df-chow</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b491e41297256b44\" href=\"?note=b491e41297256b44\" title=\"27-df-dual\">27-df-dual</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3413562300b98864\" href=\"?note=3413562300b98864\" title=\"27-df-variablepolarity\">27-df-variablepolarity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.6.2 Theorem 9.24"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"431–432"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"455–456"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-counting-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[n]\">\\(i\\in[n]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_j\">\\(c_j\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widetilde{\\mathrm{Chow}}\">\\(\\widetilde{\\mathrm{Chow}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"260aad3bc2408854\" href=\"?note=260aad3bc2408854\" title=\"27-df-chow\">27-df-chow</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dual}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Dual}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b491e41297256b44\" href=\"?note=b491e41297256b44\" title=\"27-df-dual\">27-df-dual</a>，同维坐标更新 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x[i\\leftarrow b]\">\\(x[i\\leftarrow b]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3413562300b98864\" href=\"?note=3413562300b98864\" title=\"27-df-variablepolarity\">27-df-variablepolarity</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_j:\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\to\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\pi_j:\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\to\\mathbb Z\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\le j\\le n\">\\(0\\le j\\le n\\)</span>）、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_i:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\delta_i:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb Z\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^d\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f^d\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> 由下式构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi_0(q)\\coloneqq c_0(q)-2^{n-1},\\qquad\\pi_j(q)\\coloneqq2c_j(q)-c_0(q)\\quad(q\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,\\ j\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi_0(q)\\coloneqq c_0(q)-2^{n-1},\\qquad\\pi_j(q)\\coloneqq2c_j(q)-c_0(q)\\quad(q\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,\\ j\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f^d\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Dual}_n(f),\\qquad\\delta_i(x)\\coloneqq f(x[i\\leftarrow1])-f(x[i\\leftarrow0])\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f^d\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Dual}_n(f),\\qquad\\delta_i(x)\\coloneqq f(x[i\\leftarrow1])-f(x[i\\leftarrow0])\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i(f)=\\sum_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ x_i=0}\\delta_i(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi_i(f)=\\sum_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ x_i=0}\\delta_i(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\delta_i(x)\\ge0\\right)\\Rightarrow\n\\left(\\pi_i(f)&gt;0\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\delta_i(x)\\ne0\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\delta_i(x)\\ge0\\right)\\Rightarrow\n\\left(\\pi_i(f)&gt;0\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\delta_i(x)\\ne0\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\delta_i(x)\\le0\\right)\\Rightarrow\n\\left(\\pi_i(f)&lt;0\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\delta_i(x)\\ne0\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\delta_i(x)\\le0\\right)\\Rightarrow\n\\left(\\pi_i(f)&lt;0\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\delta_i(x)\\ne0\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\delta_i(x)=0\\right)\\Rightarrow\\pi_i(f)=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\delta_i(x)=0\\right)\\Rightarrow\\pi_i(f)=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widetilde{\\mathrm{Chow}}(f^d)=(-\\pi_0(f),\\pi_1(f),\\ldots,\\pi_n(f)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widetilde{\\mathrm{Chow}}(f^d)=(-\\pi_0(f),\\pi_1(f),\\ldots,\\pi_n(f)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 9.24(1)–(3),(6)，印刷 pp.431–432／PDF pp.455–456。按坐标把真点计数配对得到差分求和，同号有限和严格非零恰在某对发生变化时成立。对偶的真点总数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^n-c_0(f)\">\\(2^n-c_0(f)\\)</span>，第i真坐标数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{n-1}-c_0(f)+c_i(f)\">\\(2^{n-1}-c_0(f)+c_i(f)\\)</span>，代入得结论。无单调性时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i=0\">\\(\\pi_i=0\\)</span> 不推出虚变量，例如异或。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-chow","status":"resolved","id":"260aad3bc2408854","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","head